        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "克离火为进神，吉利。坤、艮土被克入则为退神。坤与癸正配没有忌讳，艮则凶险。"
      },
      {
        "id": "book018-b003398-p000-279f9032f8",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "heading",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "## 坤山属土"
      },
      {
        "id": "book018-b003399-p000-2c2eb79ec3",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "离火生入为进神，吉利。克出壬、子、癸也为进神，吉利。生出申、庚、酉、辛为退神，凶险。克入寅、卯、甲、乙也为退神，凶险。甲、乙没有忌讳，只有卯为凶险。"
      },
      {
        "id": "book018-b003400-p000-c99b905942",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "heading",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "## 寅山属木"
      },
      {
        "id": "book018-b003401-p000-5c8c4e70eb",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "壬、子、癸水生入为进神，吉利。克出坤土也为进神，吉利。生出丙、丁巳火为退神，凶险。克入乾、申金正配，不凶险。"
      },
      {
        "id": "book018-b003402-p000-707bcadf44",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "heading",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "## 甲山属木"
      },
      {
        "id": "book018-b003403-p000-2e161ac8a7",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "壬子癸水生入为进神，吉利。克出坤土为进神，吉利。生出丙丁火为退神，凶险。克入乾、申金正配，不凶险。"
      },
      {
        "id": "book018-b003404-p000-55a6a307f7",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "heading",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "## 乙山属木"
      },
      {
        "id": "book018-b003405-p000-541cbedeee",
        "language": "classical_chinese",
        "content_type": "prose",
        "action": "rewrite",
        "modern_text": "壬、癸水生入，为进神，吉利。克出坤、辰、戌土，为进神，吉利。生出丙、丁火为退神，凶险。克入乾、申金正配，不凶险。"
